    "created_at": "2017-09-10T22:48:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-10T22:48:36Z",
    "body": "So the last step currently only covers modal `<dialog>`. My question would be, should we remove its `open` attribute at the same time? Should we fire `close` event?\r\n\r\nAlso it seems to me that the HTML spec already says\r\n> If at any time a dialog element is removed from a Document, then if that dialog is in that Document's top layer, it must be removed from it.\r\n\r\nWould one of them be a duplicate?\r\n\r\nBTW, the sentence in the HTML spec would raise interesting interaction between `<dialog>` and fullscreen element, which would be resolved by #91.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/fullscreen/issues/comments/328377747/reactions",
      "total_count": 0,
